{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">由高海寧、馬國明、郭柏妍等主演的新劇《夫妻的博弈》，於今晚（3日）在翡翠台首播！劇集未開播已話題度爆棚，當中飾演女主角「姜幸如」年輕版的鍾柔美（Yumi），日前率先在社交平台發布與女主角高海寧（高Ling）的同框合照。兩人在劇中的「同款造型」瞬間震撼一眾劇迷，引爆全網熱烈討論！</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"81b70798-772c-4341-b902-411690f21721.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026VbtB6V0iEJ1785739385.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"81b70798-772c-4341-b902-411690f21721.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">從鍾柔美上載的合照與自拍可見，兩人均以同款蓬鬆曲髮及眼鏡 Look 亮相。雖然造型風格一致，但兩人穿搭展現出不同時期的氣質，鍾柔美身穿白襯衫搭黑色領結，外加羽絨外套，散發出青澀學生妹氣息；而高海寧則身穿簡約白色長袖衫搭配牛仔褲，盡顯成年後的溫婉知性美。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">合照曝光後，大批網民與劇迷紛紛湧入留言讚好，大讚劇組選角極具眼光：「五官輪廓激似親姊妹」、「簡直係神還原！」、「Yumi 個造型青澀感爆棚，完全拿捏到年輕版嘅感覺」、「印象中高Ling第一次嘗試呢種造型，真係好期待今晚嘅演出！」</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"26d306e2-0901-485f-b279-dffdc8d8d334.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026RZVTEMDA5K1785739385.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"26d306e2-0901-485f-b279-dffdc8d8d334.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"6b821224-08a3-4ae8-9cfb-12c23058b8d9.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026Q4gcozINhX1785739385.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"6b821224-08a3-4ae8-9cfb-12c23058b8d9.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-03T07:18:56.989841+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":381,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}